    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuff your cheeks with onigiri and make friends with even more friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Castle X&quot;, you control a character who transforms by stuffing their cheeks with onigiri. Take on the challenge of the &quot;Cat's Castle&quot; in this platformer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A protagonist who transforms by eating onigiri</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your interactions with onigiri and others change as you transform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stages with even more challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 640x480 pixel world with 16x16 pixel characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New mode: &quot;VERY EASY&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New item: &quot;Umbrella&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With just a D-pad and two buttons, &quot;I&quot; can jump, shoot, and eat the onigiri I stuff my cheeks with\u2014that\u2019s it! Master different behaviors in various situations, overcome gimmicks, clear stages, and take on the mysterious castle once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Streaming Guidelines</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game allows video streaming and monetization with no restrictions for both individuals and businesses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stuff your cheeks with onigiri and make friends with even more friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Castle X&quot;, you control a character who transforms by stuffing their cheeks with onigiri. Take on the challenge of the &quot;Cat's Castle&quot; in this platformer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A protagonist who transforms by eating onigiri</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your interactions with onigiri and others change as you transform</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stages with even more challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 640x480 pixel world with 16x16 pixel characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New mode: &quot;VERY EASY&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New item: &quot;Umbrella&quot; added</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A prequel to &quot;Me and (My) Cat's Island&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With just a D-pad and two buttons, &quot;I&quot; can jump, shoot, and eat the onigiri I stuff my cheeks with\u2014that\u2019s it! Master different behaviors in various situations, overcome gimmicks, clear stages, and take on the mysterious castle once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Streaming Guidelines</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game allows video streaming and monetization with no restrictions for both individuals and businesses.</p>",
